{"asset_key":"ep4/quest_story_14212020","episode":"ep4","category":"quest_story","story_id":"14212020","schema_version":1,"lang":"en","texts":{"say:1:1421202001:0":{"text":"I need to speak with you on a matter that involves Feli.","source_cn":"其实，这次找你是为了斐利尔的事情。","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x48088D9A52532452","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"I need to speak with you on a matter that involves Feli.","female":"I need to speak with you on a matter that involves Feli.","variant_male_record_index":"163202","variant_female_record_index":"163203","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1421202002:0":{"text":"This is Liv. She has something she wants to give us.","source_cn":"旁边这位是丽芙，她有重要的东西要交给我们。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF199796A9C55F75A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1421202003:0":{"text":"G-greetings, Magister <style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>... I trained under Master Feli as an apprentice priestess.","source_cn":"<style=stress><player_name>...","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x379AC9E6AA40D128","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"G-greetings, Magister <style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>... I trained under Master Feli as an apprentice priestess.","female":"G-greetings, Magister <style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>... I trained under Master Feli as an apprentice priestess.","variant_male_record_index":"163205","variant_female_record_index":"163206","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1421202004:0":{"text":"After Master Feli passed away, I saw High Priestess Velara sending people to destroy his belongings...","source_cn":"斐利尔大人去世后，我看到奎茵大祭司正派人销毁斐利尔大人...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x82D1B6AB8D4DED38","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"picture:7::1":{"text":"Feli's Notebook","source_cn":"斐利尔的研究笔记","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8250D3782D409ED8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1421202005:2":{"text":"I-I snuck in and took this. I'm sorry. I shouldn't have, but...","source_cn":"我、我就偷偷溜进去拿出了这个。对不起，我只拿出了这个……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x93A35E9EEC73C998","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:8:1421202005":{"text":"I-I snuck in and took this. I'm sorry. I shouldn't have, but...","source_cn":"我、我就偷偷溜进去拿出了这个。对不起，我只拿出了这个……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x93A35E9EEC73C998","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1421202006:0":{"text":"*Cry*... It's all in the past now... That's why I came to find Master Indris.","source_cn":"呜呜，现在一切都过去了。所以我才来找到因度厄大人……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x41F087DDD705D9FD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1421202007: